# Copy to .env.local (gitignored). Loaded by mise [env]._.file when activated/direnv.
# See docs/TOOLING.md and README Verification section.
#
# Do NOT put secrets in .envrc — only `use mise` belongs there.
#
# Optional AI keys for coding agents (never commit):
# Prefer provider keys with spend caps. Agent desktop apps may need their own secret UI
# if they do not inherit this shell environment.
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=

# Optional local overrides (examples — uncomment as needed):
# OPENCLINXR_DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
# MONGODB_URI=mongodb://127.0.0.1:27017
# Sketchfab model download (equipment bank / CC-BY GLBs). Create at sketchfab.com/settings/password
# SKETCHFAB_API_TOKEN=
# Paid cloud provider keys must stay out of committed templates (architecture paid-provider gate).

